  "notes": "Parody of a Palantir-style intelligence console applied to a family trip: 'UNCLASSIFIED // FAMILY OPS', 'Response plans', 'Mission scrub', 'Weather intel / NOAA', 'Risk watch'. GitHub-dark palette (#0d1117/#161b22/#30363d, #58a6ff blue) with per-family color coding (orange/red/purple) on routes and timeline bars, colored outlined status chips (WATCH amber, ASSIGNED blue, GO green). 1–2px radii everywhere, 1px hairline borders, tiny tracked uppercase labels. Timeline has weather forecast per day as column headers plus playback controls (play, restart, 1x) that animate the cursor. Selecting a family or timeline item drives the map camera, time scrub, live lists and the right detail aside."
}
